{%- comment -%}
  Lucent Nattokinase 4-in-1 Cardio Complex PDP: gallery + buy box with a native
  bundle picker, jump nav, three-video demo, trust marquee, how-it-works GIF band,
  animated stats, why-it-works cards, testimonials, second GIF band, compare table,
  what's-inside, reviews + write-a-review modal, FAQ, final CTA, sticky add-to-cart.
  Live Shopify product/variant data drives price and checkout.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
{%- assign rating_mf = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value -%}
{%- assign rating = rating_mf.rating | default: rating_mf -%}
{%- if rating == blank -%}{%- assign rating = s.rating -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign review_count = s.review_count | default: '1,184' -%}
{%- assign guarantee = s.guarantee_days | default: 60 -%}

<section class="pdp" id="product-buy">
  <div class="wrap pdp__grid">
    <div class="pdp__media" data-pdp-gallery>
      <figure class="pdp__main" data-pdp-main>
        <img src="{{ 'lucent-hero.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Lucent Nattokinase 10,800 FU 4-in-1 Cardio Complex bottle" width="1024" height="1024" loading="eager">
        <button class="pdp__gallery-arrow pdp__gallery-arrow--prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous product image" data-pdp-gallery-prev>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="pdp__gallery-arrow pdp__gallery-arrow--next" type="button" aria-label="Next product image" data-pdp-gallery-next>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </button>
      </figure>
      <div class="pdp__thumbs" aria-label="Product images">
        <button class="pdp__thumb" type="button" data-pdp-thumb data-full="{{ 'lucent-hero.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-alt="Lucent Nattokinase 10,800 FU 4-in-1 Cardio Complex bottle" aria-current="true"><img src="{{ 'lucent-hero.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Lucent Nattokinase bottle" width="84" height="84"></button>
        <button class="pdp__thumb" type="button" data-pdp-thumb data-full="{{ 'lucent-benefits.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-alt="Four enzymes and nutrients, one cardio ritual: flows, clears, directs" aria-current="false"><img src="{{ 'lucent-benefits.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Flows, clears, directs" width="84" height="84" loading="lazy"></button>
        <button class="pdp__thumb" type="button" data-pdp-thumb data-full="{{ 'lucent-how-to.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-alt="One capsule daily with a meal" aria-current="false"><img src="{{ 'lucent-how-to.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="One capsule daily" width="84" height="84" loading="lazy"></button>
        <button class="pdp__thumb" type="button" data-pdp-thumb data-full="{{ 'lucent-stats.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-alt="Lucent customer survey results graphic" aria-current="false"><img src="{{ 'lucent-stats.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Customer results" width="84" height="84" loading="lazy"></button>
        <button class="pdp__thumb" type="button" data-pdp-thumb data-full="{{ 'lucent-ingredients.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-alt="Japan's longevity ritual in a capsule: nattokinase, serrapeptase, lumbrokinase and vitamin K2" aria-current="false"><img src="{{ 'lucent-ingredients.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Ingredients" width="84" height="84" loading="lazy"></button>
        <button class="pdp__thumb" type="button" data-pdp-thumb data-full="{{ 'lucent-facts.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-alt="Supplement facts label" aria-current="false"><img src="{{ 'lucent-facts.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Supplement facts" width="84" height="84" loading="lazy"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="pdp-media-proof"><span>10,800 FU nattokinase</span><span>1 capsule a day</span><span>Enteric-coated · soy-free</span></div>
    </div>

    <aside class="pdp__buy" data-pdp-buybox>
      <div class="pdp__proof-stack">
        {%- if rating != blank -%}
        <div class="pdp__ratingline pdp__ratingline--inline">
          <span class="stars" aria-hidden="true" data-stars="{{ rating }}">★★★★★</span>
          <span class="pdp__ratingtxt">Rated {{ rating }}{% if review_count != blank %} · {{ review_count }} reviews{% endif %}</span>
        </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        <p class="pdp__month-proof"><span class="pdp__month-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ s.monthly_social_proof | default: '4k+ bottles shipped this month.' }}</p>
      </div>

      <p class="eyebrow pdp__eyebrow">{{ s.pdp_eyebrow | default: "The daily cardio capsule" }}</p>
      <h1>{{ product.title | default: 'Lucent Nattokinase 4-in-1 Cardio Complex' }}</h1>
      <p class="pdp__lead"><strong>{{ s.pdp_lead_strong | default: "Japan's longevity habit, without the natto." }}</strong> {{ s.pdp_lead_body | default: "10,800 FU nattokinase with serrapeptase, lumbrokinase and vitamin K2 (MK-7) in one enteric-coated capsule a day" }}. {{ guarantee }}-day money-back guarantee.</p>

      <ul class="pdp__benefits">
        <li>Supports healthy circulation and blood flow*</li>
        <li>Helps maintain normal fibrin balance*</li>
        <li>Vitamin K2 helps direct calcium to bones, not arteries*</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="pdp__price" aria-live="polite">
        <span class="pdp__now" data-pdp-now>{{ v.price | money }}</span><span class="pdp__unit" data-pdp-unit>/ bottle</span>
        <span class="pdp__was" data-pdp-was {% unless v.compare_at_price > v.price %}style="display:none"{% endunless %}>{{ v.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
        {%- assign off = 0 -%}
        {%- if v.compare_at_price > v.price -%}{%- assign off = v.compare_at_price | minus: v.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: v.compare_at_price | round -%}{%- endif -%}
        <span class="pdp__save" data-pdp-save {% if off == 0 %}style="display:none"{% endif %}>{% if off > 0 %}{{ s.sale_label | default: 'Launch sale' }} · save {{ off }}%{% endif %}</span>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        Native bundle picker. If the product has more than one variant (e.g. "1 Bottle",
        "2 Bottles", "3 Bottles") each card is a variant with its own price. With a single
        variant the cards fall back to quantity tiers at the plain unit price.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <fieldset class="pdp__opts" data-pdp-opts>
        <legend class="pdp__opts-label">Bundle &amp; save</legend>
        {%- if product.variants.size > 1 -%}
          {%- for var in product.variants -%}
            {%- assign qty = 1 -%}
            {%- assign first_word = var.title | split: ' ' | first | plus: 0 -%}
            {%- if first_word > 0 -%}{%- assign qty = first_word -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- assign unit = var.price | divided_by: qty -%}
            {%- assign vsave = 0 -%}
            {%- if var.compare_at_price > var.price -%}{%- assign vsave = var.compare_at_price | minus: var.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: var.compare_at_price | round -%}{%- endif -%}
            <button type="button" class="pdp__opt" data-pdp-opt data-vid="{{ var.id }}" data-qty="1" data-price="{{ var.price | divided_by: 100.0 }}" data-compare="{{ var.compare_at_price | default: 0 | divided_by: 100.0 }}" data-units="{{ qty }}" data-active="{% if var.id == v.id %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" aria-pressed="{% if var.id == v.id %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" {% unless var.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
              <span class="pdp__opt__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="pdp__opt__body"><span class="pdp__opt__name">{{ var.title }}{% if forloop.index == 2 %} <em class="pdp__opt__tag">Most popular</em>{% elsif forloop.last and forloop.index > 2 %} <em class="pdp__opt__tag">Best value</em>{% endif %}</span><span class="pdp__opt__sub">{{ qty | times: 60 }}-day supply{% if forloop.last and forloop.index > 2 %} · free express shipping{% endif %}{% unless var.available %} · sold out{% endunless %}</span></span>
              <span class="pdp__opt__price">{{ unit | money }} <small>/ bottle</small>{% if vsave > 0 %}<s>{{ var.compare_at_price | divided_by: qty | money }}</s>{% endif %}</span>
            </button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- for qty in (1..3) -%}
            <button type="button" class="pdp__opt" data-pdp-opt data-vid="{{ v.id }}" data-qty="{{ qty }}" data-price="{{ v.price | divided_by: 100.0 }}" data-compare="{{ v.compare_at_price | default: 0 | divided_by: 100.0 }}" data-units="{{ qty }}" data-active="{% if qty == 1 %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" aria-pressed="{% if qty == 1 %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">
              <span class="pdp__opt__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="pdp__opt__body"><span class="pdp__opt__name">{{ qty }} Bottle{% if qty > 1 %}s{% endif %}{% if qty == 2 %} <em class="pdp__opt__tag">Most popular</em>{% elsif qty == 3 %} <em class="pdp__opt__tag">Best value</em>{% endif %}</span><span class="pdp__opt__sub">{{ qty | times: 60 }}-day supply{% if qty == 3 %} · free express shipping{% endif %}</span></span>
              <span class="pdp__opt__price">{{ v.price | money }} <small>/ bottle</small>{% if off > 0 %}<s>{{ v.compare_at_price | money }}</s>{% endif %}</span>
            </button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </fieldset>

      <div class="pdp__shipbar"><span class="pdp__shipbar-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="17" height="17"><path d="M3 6.5h11v9H3zM14 9.5h3.6l3.4 3.3v2.7h-7z"/><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="1.7"/><circle cx="17.4" cy="18" r="1.7"/></svg></span> <strong>Ships from the U.S.</strong> · fast tracked delivery, typically 3–7 days</div>

      {%- form 'product', product, id: 'pdp-form' -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ v.id }}" data-pdp-variant>
        <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1" data-pdp-quantity>
        <button type="submit" name="add" class="btn btn--block btn--lg pdp__atc" data-pdp-atc {% unless product.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
          <span data-pdp-atc-label>{% if product.available %}{{ s.cta_text | default: 'Add to cart' }}{% else %}Sold out{% endif %}</span>
          {% if product.available %}<span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span data-pdp-button-price>{{ v.price | money }}</span>{% endif %}
        </button>
        {% if s.show_dynamic_checkout and product.available %}<div class="pdp__express-btn">{{ form | payment_button }}</div>{% endif %}
      {%- endform -%}

      <ul class="pdp__badges" aria-label="Guarantees">
        <li><span class="pdp__badge-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="14" height="14"><path d="M12 21c5-3 8-6 8-11V5l-8-3-8 3v5c0 5 3 8 8 11Z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>Third-party tested · made in the USA</li>
        <li><span class="pdp__badge-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="14" height="14"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="4"/><path d="M8 12h8"/></svg></span>Enteric-coated · soy-free · non-GMO</li>
        <li><span class="pdp__badge-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="14" height="14"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 1 1-2.3-5.6"/><path d="M20 4v4h-4"/></svg></span>{{ guarantee }}-day guarantee</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="pdp-acc">
        <details><summary>What's included</summary><p><strong>Each bottle:</strong> 60 delayed-release vegetable capsules. Every capsule delivers 10,800 FU nattokinase, 180,000 SPU serrapeptase, 40 mg lumbrokinase and 180 mcg vitamin K2 as MK-7. One a day for everyday support, two a day if you want the full 60-day bottle in a month.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How to take</summary><p>One capsule daily with water and a meal. The enteric coating is designed to carry the enzymes past stomach acid and release them in the intestines, so swallow whole and don't open the capsule. Adults only.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is it safe with medication?</summary><p>Nattokinase, serrapeptase and lumbrokinase are fibrinolytic enzymes and vitamin K2 affects clotting. If you take blood thinners, aspirin or any prescription medicine, are pregnant or nursing, or have surgery scheduled, talk to your doctor before starting.</p></details>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<nav class="pdp-jump" aria-label="Product information">
  <div class="wrap pdp-jump__inner">
    <a href="#why-made">How it works</a><a href="#demo">Watch it work</a><a href="#why-works">Why it works</a><a href="#pdp-testimonials">Reviews</a><a href="#pdp-formula">What's inside</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
