{%- comment -%} ===== COMPARE ===== {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="reuse" id="pdp-compare">
  <div class="wrap reuse__grid">
    <div class="reuse__copy"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">{{ s.compare_eyebrow | default: "Skip the natto. Skip the four bottles." }}</p><h2>{{ s.compare_title | default: "Eating natto daily is a chore. This isn't." }}</h2><p>{{ s.compare_body | default: "Natto has to be bought fresh, stirred and swallowed with that smell, and it takes several servings to reach 10,000 FU. Single-ingredient capsules fix the taste but stop at nattokinase. Lucent seals the full cardio stack into one enteric-coated capsule." }}</p></div>
    <div class="reuse__table" role="table" aria-label="Lucent compared with natto and single-ingredient capsules">
      <div class="rt__row rt__row--head" role="row"><span></span><span class="rt__us">Lucent</span><span>Natto &amp; single capsules</span></div>
      <div class="rt__row"><span>Nattokinase per serving</span><span class="rt__yes">10,800 FU</span><span class="rt__no">Often 2,000–4,000 FU</span></div>
      <div class="rt__row"><span>Serrapeptase + lumbrokinase</span><span class="rt__yes">Built in</span><span class="rt__no">Separate bottles</span></div>
      <div class="rt__row"><span>Vitamin K2 (MK-7)</span><span class="rt__yes">180 mcg</span><span class="rt__no">Usually not</span></div>
      <div class="rt__row"><span>Enteric coating</span><span class="rt__yes">Yes</span><span class="rt__no">Rarely</span></div>
      <div class="rt__row"><span>Fermented-soybean taste</span><span class="rt__yes">None</span><span class="rt__no">Natto: yes</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} ===== WHAT'S INSIDE ===== {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="ingredients" id="pdp-formula">
  <div class="wrap ingredients__grid">
    <div class="ingredients__intro"><p class="eyebrow">{{ s.formula_eyebrow | default: "What's inside" }}</p><h2>{{ s.formula_title | default: "Every capsule, on the label." }}</h2><p>{{ s.formula_body | default: "Serving size 1 capsule · 60 servings per bottle · delayed-release vegetable capsules. Soy-free, non-GMO, nothing to mix." }}</p><details class="inci"><summary>Other ingredients &amp; cautions</summary><p>Delayed-release vegetable capsule (hypromellose, gellan gum), rice flour, magnesium stearate (vegetable source). <strong>Adults only.</strong> Consult a healthcare professional before use if you are pregnant, nursing, take blood-thinning or other medication, have a bleeding disorder or have surgery scheduled.</p></details></div>
    <ul class="ing-list">
      <li><strong>Nattokinase · 10,800 FU</strong><span>The enzyme from fermented natto, studied for supporting healthy fibrin balance and circulation.*</span></li>
      <li><strong>Serrapeptase · 180,000 SPU</strong><span>A proteolytic enzyme studied for supporting a healthy inflammatory response.*</span></li>
      <li><strong>Lumbrokinase · 40 mg</strong><span>A fibrinolytic enzyme studied for its role in fibrin breakdown and healthy blood flow.*</span></li>
      <li><strong>Vitamin K2 (MK-7) · 180 mcg</strong><span>Activates the proteins that direct calcium into bone rather than soft tissue.*</span></li>
      <li><strong>Enteric coating</strong><span>Designed to carry the enzymes past stomach acid and release them in the intestines.</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} ===== REVIEWS + BREAKDOWN + WRITE A REVIEW ===== {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="rblock" id="reviews">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">{{ s.reviews_eyebrow | default: "Product reviews" }}</p><h2>{% if review_count != blank %}{{ review_count }} {% endif %}{{ s.reviews_title_suffix | default: "reviews and counting." }}</h2></header>
    <div class="rblock__grid">
      <div class="rblock__summary">
        {%- if rating != blank -%}<p class="rblock__big">{{ rating }}</p><p class="rblock__stars" data-stars="{{ rating }}" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</p>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if review_count != blank -%}<p class="rblock__count">{{ review_count }} verified reviews</p>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if rating != blank -%}
        <div class="rblock__bars">
          {%- assign d5 = 84 -%}{%- assign d4 = 11 -%}{%- assign d3 = 3 -%}{%- assign d2 = 1 -%}{%- assign d1 = 1 -%}
          <div class="rbar"><span>5★</span><span class="rbar__track"><span class="rbar__fill" style="width:{{ d5 }}%"></span></span><span>{{ d5 }}%</span></div>
          <div class="rbar"><span>4★</span><span class="rbar__track"><span class="rbar__fill" style="width:{{ d4 }}%"></span></span><span>{{ d4 }}%</span></div>
          <div class="rbar"><span>3★</span><span class="rbar__track"><span class="rbar__fill" style="width:{{ d3 }}%"></span></span><span>{{ d3 }}%</span></div>
          <div class="rbar"><span>2★</span><span class="rbar__track"><span class="rbar__fill" style="width:{{ d2 }}%"></span></span><span>{{ d2 }}%</span></div>
          <div class="rbar"><span>1★</span><span class="rbar__track"><span class="rbar__fill" style="width:{{ d1 }}%"></span></span><span>{{ d1 }}%</span></div>
        </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--invert btn--block" data-review-open>Write a review</button>
      </div>
      <div class="rblock__list">
        <article class="rev2"><header><span class="rev2__av" style="--a:#8E2C2C;--b:#E7C873">RT</span><div><strong>Ray T.</strong><span class="rev2__meta">Verified buyer · ★★★★★</span></div></header><h3>Finally one capsule, not five</h3><p>Replaced three bottles with one. 10,800 FU is more than I was getting from two capsules of my old brand, and the K2 is in there too.</p></article>
        <article class="rev2"><header><span class="rev2__av" style="--a:#15161B;--b:#C9A24A">DM</span><div><strong>Denise M.</strong><span class="rev2__meta">Verified buyer · ★★★★☆</span></div></header><h3>Give it the full bottle</h3><p>Nothing dramatic in week one. By week four my dad said his legs felt lighter on his evening walk. Reordered the 3-pack for both of us.</p></article>
        <article class="rev2"><header><span class="rev2__av" style="--a:#2A2C34;--b:#E7C873">KL</span><div><strong>Ken L.</strong><span class="rev2__meta">Verified buyer · ★★★★★</span></div></header><h3>Tried natto. Never again.</h3><p>Lasted four days eating natto. This is the enzyme without the smell, no burping, and I take it with coffee and forget about it.</p></article>
        <button type="button" class="rblock__more btn btn--invert" data-review-more>See more reviews</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} ===== FAQ ===== {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="pdp-faq" id="faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions">
  <div class="wrap pdp-faq__grid">
    <header class="pdp-faq__head"><h2>{{ s.faq_heading | default: "Frequently Asked Questions" }}</h2></header>
    <div class="pdp-faq__list">
      <details><summary>How many capsules do I take?</summary><p>One capsule a day with water and a meal. One bottle is 60 capsules, a full 60 days at that dose. Some people take two a day for a 30-day bottle; check with your doctor before going higher. The 2- and 3-bottle bundles cover the 3 to 6 months most people give it.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Why does 10,000 FU matter?</summary><p>FU (fibrinolytic units) measure enzyme activity. The clips everyone's sharing talk about at least 10,000 FU a day, which would take five or six servings of natto. Lucent delivers 10,800 FU in one capsule.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What is the enteric coating for?</summary><p>Enzymes are proteins, and stomach acid breaks proteins down. The delayed-release capsule is designed to pass the stomach and release in the intestines so the enzymes reach where they can be absorbed. Swallow whole.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Does it contain soy?</summary><p>No. Nattokinase is produced by fermenting with Bacillus subtilis natto, then purified. The finished capsule is soy-free, non-GMO and third-party tested.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I take it with blood thinners or other medication?</summary><p>Not without talking to your doctor. Nattokinase, serrapeptase and lumbrokinase affect fibrin and vitamin K2 affects clotting. Skip it if you are pregnant, nursing, have a bleeding disorder or have surgery within two weeks.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What's the guarantee?</summary><p>A {{ guarantee }}-day money-back guarantee. If it isn't for you, contact us and we'll help with your order.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="final"><div class="wrap final__inner"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">{{ s.final_eyebrow | default: "The daily cardio capsule" }}</p><h2>{{ s.final_title | default: "Make the one-capsule cardio habit part of your morning." }}</h2><p>{{ s.final_body | default: "10,800 FU nattokinase, serrapeptase, lumbrokinase and vitamin K2 in one enteric-coated capsule a day." }}</p><button type="button" class="btn btn--invert btn--lg" data-pdp-sticky-submit>{{ s.final_cta_text | default: s.cta_text | default: "Add to cart, 100% risk-free" }}</button></div></section>

<div class="pdp-sticky" data-pdp-sticky><div class="pdp-sticky__in"><div><div class="pdp-sticky__n">{{ product.title | default: 'Lucent Nattokinase' }}</div><div class="pdp-sticky__p" data-pdp-sticky-price>{{ v.price | money }}</div></div><button type="button" class="btn" data-pdp-sticky-submit>Add to cart</button></div></div>

{%- comment -%} ===== WRITE-A-REVIEW MODAL ===== {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="review-modal" data-review-modal hidden>
  <div class="review-modal__scrim" data-review-close></div>
  <div class="review-modal__card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Write a review">
    <button type="button" class="review-modal__x" data-review-close aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
    <h3>Write a review</h3>
    <div class="review-modal__field"><label for="rm-name">Your name</label><input id="rm-name" type="text" data-review-name></div>
    <div class="review-modal__field"><label id="rm-rating-label">Rating</label><div class="review-modal__stars" data-review-stars role="group" aria-labelledby="rm-rating-label"><button type="button" data-star="1" aria-label="1 star">★</button><button type="button" data-star="2" aria-label="2 stars">★</button><button type="button" data-star="3" aria-label="3 stars">★</button><button type="button" data-star="4" aria-label="4 stars">★</button><button type="button" data-star="5" aria-label="5 stars">★</button></div></div>
    <div class="review-modal__field"><label for="rm-text">Your review</label><textarea id="rm-text" rows="4" data-review-text></textarea></div>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--block" data-review-submit>Submit review</button>
    <p class="review-modal__note" data-review-msg aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>
</div>

